{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udc04 <strong>Feng Shui: Meowjong \u2013 Demo Version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a unique blend of traditional Mahjong and roguelike strategy in this demo of <i>Feng Shui: Meowjong</i>. This demo offers a glimpse into the game's core mechanics and strategic depth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>What\u2019s Included in the Demo</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mahjong-Based Gameplay</strong>: Play with a fixed hand of 14 tiles, forming Pongs, Chis, and Pairs to score points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tile Arrangement Mechanics</strong>: Manually arrange and swap tiles to optimize your hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Feng Shui Treasures</strong>: Collect and place treasures in cardinal directions to activate their powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ang Pao System</strong>: Earn points through tile combinations to gain advantages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limited Skill Cards</strong>: Utilize a selection of skill cards to enhance your strategy.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf10 <strong>Supported Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Languages</strong>: English, Simplified Chinese</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Player Modes</strong>: Single-player</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note that this demo represents a portion of the full game and is intended to showcase its core mechanics and strategic elements.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581250?t=1747619924","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581250?t=1747619924","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581250/53f5e4b144a6bd4e09de77f6cb8f556ece6cea38/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747619924","capsule